Significance: patch
Type: security

While the plugin is active but cannot boot, WordPress refuses every edit, moderation, trashing and deletion of an internal comment, on its screens and through its REST API, until the plugin has booted and relaxed the internal_comments/core_comment_actions/should_restrict filter, and its capabilities decide; WooCommerce's order-note routes and note deletion refuse internal comments, and comment queries, feeds and core's REST and XML-RPC comment lists leave them out, those 1.2.4 stored approved included, whether or not it has booted.
